      "writtenOn": "2024-08-05T16:00:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In `zassert_*` function family this should contain additional message, not a type specifier:\n\nFrom `subsys/testsuite/ztest/include/zephyr/ztest_assert.h`\n```\n/**\n * @brief Assert that @a a equals @a b\n *\n * @a a and @a b won\u0027t be converted and will be compared directly.\n *\n * @param a Value to compare\n * @param b Value to compare\n * @param ... Optional message and variables to print if the assertion fails\n */\n#define zassert_equal(a, b, ...) zassert((a) \u003d\u003d (b), #a \" not equal to \" #b, ##__VA_ARGS__)\n```\n\nI think the best option is to remove these specifiers. Please also prepare patch that removes this in already merged tests.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 63,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 67
